# SCENARIO: fix_117_stair_base_no_false_skip   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Fix #117 - the FC machine's planned-hop leg measures its 15 s per-waypoint budget as time WITHOUT
# getting closer, so a long queued approach no longer reaches the stair with the budget already spent.
# PRECONDITION: debug mode with the bot pinned: `/cavebot reload debug,$R`.
# Run: runner.py fix_117_stair_base_no_false_skip.steps --var R=<name>   (baseline bot: Kaelis Duke)
# Replays baseline B5 G3 FROM WHERE IT REALLY STARTED: the bot was at (32399,32216,7) (the end of G2,
# the potions shop), not at the temple -> ammo shop z6 via the stairs at (32350,32246,7).
# Baseline (2026-11-18, pre batch 1): the bot walked a 73-step queued path to the stair, reached the
# stair base at t+27 s and the FC leg skipped the portal on its first call: `pathout stuck
# route=ZLEG reason=wp-skip-timeout val=27406` at (32349,32246,7). Batch 1 (#42) turns that skip
# into a retry, but it still logs the false stuck and charges a strike toward the 3-strike quarantine.
# Acceptance (server truth):
#   - PRECONDITION CHECK (non-vacuous): a path record for the bot whose destination is the stair
#     (32350,32246,7) with len >= 40 -- a single queued approach long enough to outlast the old
#     15 s wall clock. If this fails the run did NOT exercise the bug (route changed); report it as
#     "not exercised", not as a pass. Matching: audit records reach the expects through
#     merge.parse_audit_text (json.loads; only `pos` is turned into a dict), so `dst` is a list and
#     the runner matches regexes against str(list) = "[32350, 32246, 7]" and `len` as "73". Checked
#     against the real baseline file runs/bl_b5/audit.ndjson with runner.parse_steps/ev_match: 2 hits
#     (len 51 and 73; the len 15/16 records are correctly excluded);
#   - zero audit `pathout outcome=stuck route=ZLEG reason=wp-skip-timeout` for the bot;
#   - zero `[ZBLACKLIST] ... site=zleg` journal lines (no strike can reach a quarantine);
#   - the bot reaches z6 within Chebyshev 1 of the goal (a probe record there).
# Run twice in a row (the 3-strike counter is per bot+portal) for a stronger signal: still 0/0.
@srv audit kinds probe,path,pathout,state,cmd
@srv audit watch $R
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv cmd "$R" teleport 32399,32216,7
@srv sleep 3
@srv audit mark "F117 G3 ammo-z6 32345,32246,6 from the potions shop"
@srv cmd "$R" goto 32345,32246,6
@srv sleep 90
@srv audit mark "F117 back to the potions shop"
@srv cmd "$R" teleport 32399,32216,7
@srv sleep 3
@srv audit mark "F117 G3 again"
@srv cmd "$R" goto 32345,32246,6
@srv sleep 90
@srv audit mark "F117 end"
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=path bot=$R dst~="^.32350, 32246, 7.$" len~="^([4-9][0-9]|[1-9][0-9]{2,})$" min=1 within=200
@srv expect-none src=srv:audit k=pathout bot=$R outcome=stuck route=ZLEG reason=wp-skip-timeout within=200
@srv expect-none src=srv k=zblacklist msg~="site=zleg" within=200
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=probe bot=$R pos~="x.: 3234[4-6], .y.: 3224[5-7], .z.: 6\}" min=1 within=200
@srv expect-none src=srv msg~="Lua Script Error" within=200
@srv audit watch clear
@srv audit off
